Image: [Wikimedia Commons](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Creed_model_7TR-B-2_reperforator.jpg)

[Telegra.ph](https://telegra.ph) is a service for writing articles,
similar to Medium. However it does not provide a simple api to export
the contents.

This is a small _Elixir_ script to fetch and transform the
information from a Telegra.ph page so the content can be used
elsewhere.

```bash
./telegraph https://telegra.ph/Sample-Page-12-15
./telegraph --path Sample-Page-12-15 --json
./telegraph --path Sample-Page-12-15 --html
./telegraph --path Sample-Page-12-15 --markdown
```

```bash
./telegraph --path Sample-Page-12-15 --json
./telegraph --file sample-page-12-15.json
```

```github
ElixirCL/telegraph | Convierte las historias de Telegraph a JSON
```
